  "verseCount": 27,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "17",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MAT 17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "17",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okoonchoka ekieni kwa Yeso",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(Mar 9:2-13; Luk 9:28-36)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na nyuma y’amatuko atano na rimo Yeso akaira Petero, na Yakobo, na Yohana momura omwabo Yakobo, bakagenda nabarabwo igoro ase egetunwa egetambe barabwo boka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akaonchoka ekieni kiaye ase bare, obosio bwaye bokagirigenta buna erioba, ne chianga chiaye chikaraba buna omobaso.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na rora, Musa na Elija bakabaorokera, bagakwana nere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Petero agateebia Yeso, “Omonene, mbuya intwe koba aiga; onye ngwancha, ninkore aiga ebigutu bitato, ekemo ekiao, ekemo ekia Musa, na ekemo eki’Elija.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero arenge gokwana, rora, riire rirabu rikababisia, na eriogi rikarwa ase riire riria, rigateba, “Oyo n’Omwana one omwanchwa, ngokirie nere; moigwere ere.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero aborokigwa bachia koigwa aya, bakagwa inse maumama, bakabwatwa nomoondoko omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende Yeso agacha akabakuna, akabora, “Imoka, timobaisa kwoboa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero bachia koimokia amaiso abo, tibarora monto otatiga Yeso bweka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kobagotirimboka korwa ase egetunwa, Yeso akabatianera, akabora, “Timoteebia monto onde okorora oko goika Omwana-o-Mwanyabaanto aboke korwa ase abakuure.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aborokigwa baye bakamobooria, “Nase ki rende aborokia b’amariiko bagoteeba ng’a negwenerete Elija ache ritang’ani?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeso akabairaneria, “Nekeene, n’Elija ogochia gocha ritang’ani, na ere naroisie onsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende nabateebirie ng’a Elija oikire gocha; na barabwo tibamomanyete, korende bakamokorera onsi aya barigetie. Naboigo n’Omwana-o-Mwanyabaanto nachie konyora emechando ase amaboko abo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio aborokigwa baye bakamanya ng’a ere nigo are kobateebia igoro ya Yohana Omobatisi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeso okogwenia omomura obwatire nekerecha",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(Mar 9:14-29; Luk 9:37-43)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero bachia goika ase omoganda, omonto oyomo akamochiera agwo, akamotung’amera, akabora,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omonene, ororere omomura one amaabera, ekiagera nare nendurume, nigo achandegete mono. Inaki ere, kero kende nigo akogwa ase omorero ime, na kero kende ase amaache ime.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namorenta ase aborokigwa bao, tibanyara komogwenia.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeso akairaneria, “Inwe ekegori getari nokwegena, naende ekebe, nimbe amo nainwe goika ririri? Nindemererie nainwe goika ririri? Mondetere aiga.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeso agatogonyera ekerecha, na kerokio kegatiga omwana oria na ere akagwenigwa ekero keria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio aborokigwa bagachiera Yeso bobisi, bakaboora, “Ninki kiagera intwe titwanyara korusia ekerecha keria?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akabateebia, “Nase engencho y’okwegena kwaino kore ogoke. Ekeene nabateebirie: Moise koba nokwegena koreng’aine buna entetere y’Omosirapi, inamoteebie egetunwa eke: Karue agwo, ogende aaria, na kerokio inakeruo, tirikoba ring’ana ritanyarekane ase more. [",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende ekerecha kenga buna eke tikegosoka otatiga ase ogosaba na okweng’ata.”]",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeso ogokwana naende igoro y’ogokwa kwaye",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(Mar 9:30-32; Luk 9:43-45)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero basangererekanete Galili, Yeso akabateebia, “Omwana-o-Mwanyabaanto ngochia are kobekwa ase amaboko y’ abanto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barabwo inabamoite, ne rituko ria gatato nabooke.” Bagaichana mono.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeso ogoakana ebango ye Hekalu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kobaikire Kapernaumu, abaare korusia ebango ye Hekalu bagachiera Petero, bakamobooria, “Inee! Omworokia oino nkorua are ebango?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akabairaneria, “Ee, nkorua are.” Goika agasoa nyomba, Yeso agatang’ana gokwana na Petero, akamobooria, “Inki okorengereria Simioni? Nase ng’o abarwoti b’ense bakorusia ebango n’echoogo? Nkorwa ase abana babo, gose nase abanto bande?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ekero Petero amoiraneria, “Nkorwa ase abande,” Yeso akamoteebia, “Rirorio abana babo barabwo nabasibore.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende titobaisa kobagechia, genda nyancha orute endobio na enswe eraache ritang’ani oyebwate; na ekero okoyiasamia omonwa oye norore egesamunye kiebesa kereo, okerusie, obae abwo ase engencho y’ane amo naye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
